{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open Star Fighter</strong> is an immersive space combat game that propels players into the heart of interstellar warfare. Developed by a passionate indie team, the game combines classic arcade shooting elements with modern graphics and gameplay mechanics, offering both casual and hardcore gamers an engaging experience.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expansive Missions:</strong> Embark on a series of missions set across various cosmic landscapes, each presenting distinct challenges and adversaries, ensuring a fresh experience with every playthrough.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning Visuals and Audio:</strong> Experience high-definition graphics that bring the vastness of space to life, complemented by a dynamic soundtrack and immersive sound effects that heighten the intensity of combat.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614520?t=1743465087","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614520?t=1743465087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614520/a1f95bf016bb2382d29bc2f9968dd13509519253/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743465087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614520/a1f95bf016bb2382d29bc2f9968dd13509519253/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743465087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open Star Fighter</strong> is an immersive space combat game that propels players into the heart of interstellar warfare. Developed by a passionate indie team, the game combines classic arcade shooting elements with modern graphics and gameplay mechanics, offering